1
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:23,300
♪Where can love ever be whole?♪

2
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:27,700
♪When will the bright moon be full?♪

3
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:30,580
♪Love and hate turn on a single thought♪

4
00:00:30,620 --> 00:00:35,300
♪The past is hard to leave, part,
or sever♪

5
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:38,980
♪My true heart has never changed♪

6
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:42,660
♪I wish to become paired swallows
with you♪

7
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:48,340
♪To meet year after year♪

8
00:00:52,580 --> 00:00:55,200
=Phoenix Rising from the Faint Moon=

9
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:57,520
(Adapted from the Fanqie Novel
Heaven-Sent Consort & Scheming Prince)

10
00:00:57,520 --> 00:00:59,500
(Author: Yun Jinque)

11
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,100
=Episode 8=

12
00:01:08,220 --> 00:01:09,740
Well...

13
00:01:12,380 --> 00:01:13,580
Haha.

14
00:01:14,060 --> 00:01:17,180
The terms you've offered are quite
generous, Your Highness.

15
00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:20,580
(Mo Xuanji, Grand Princess)
They're worth no less than a city.

16
00:01:21,340 --> 00:01:22,300
Naturally.

17
00:01:23,180 --> 00:01:26,820
Xingzhao Pavilion is a one-of-a-kind
force in the martial world of Yinbei.

18
00:01:27,140 --> 00:01:29,940
If you're willing to submit
and be incorporated into the court,

19
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:32,740
Yinbei will certainly treat you well.

20
00:01:32,980 --> 00:01:33,860
Your Highness,

21
00:01:34,020 --> 00:01:35,460
you should know very well

22
00:01:35,460 --> 00:01:38,220
that we're all rough men
from the martial world.

23
00:01:38,340 --> 00:01:39,820
We preach righteousness,

24
00:01:39,900 --> 00:01:42,620
but in truth we do the dirtiest,
most unrighteous deeds.

25
00:01:43,220 --> 00:01:45,140
Even if we were willing
to be incorporated,

26
00:01:45,220 --> 00:01:47,460
would you dare to use us?

27
00:01:47,860 --> 00:01:49,660
As long as you're willing to submit,

28
00:01:49,660 --> 00:01:51,340
of course I'd dare to use you.

29
00:01:51,700 --> 00:01:55,140
However, this time I'm not here
on behalf of the court.

30
00:01:56,780 --> 00:02:00,100
If you want as much as
what's in this brocade box,

31
00:02:00,740 --> 00:02:03,380
you can only submit to me

32
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:05,420
and serve me.

33
00:02:06,060 --> 00:02:07,420
Interesting.

34
00:02:07,740 --> 00:02:09,300
How do we submit?

35
00:02:10,380 --> 00:02:12,220
Kill someone for me.

36
00:02:13,820 --> 00:02:14,540
Your Highness,

37
00:02:15,380 --> 00:02:17,380
Consort Dowager Mei asked you
to have tea with her today.

38
00:02:17,900 --> 00:02:20,140
It's been hours.
Why hasn't she arrived yet?

39
00:02:25,340 --> 00:02:27,780
If she's still not here in half an hour,

40
00:02:28,500 --> 00:02:29,500
we leave.

41
00:02:30,940 --> 00:02:32,800
(Spring's Tender Grace)
Do you think Yuya can understand

42
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:34,580
(Spring's Tender Grace)
my good intentions?

43
00:02:35,060 --> 00:02:38,020
His own wife is meeting another man
alone,

44
00:02:38,380 --> 00:02:40,300
and he doesn't even know to make
his presence felt.

45
00:02:41,780 --> 00:02:44,060
You told His Highness
you'd go on an outing with him,

46
00:02:44,060 --> 00:02:46,580
but it's actually for this chance
encounter with his wife.

47
00:02:46,580 --> 00:02:49,260
I'm sure he will understand in time.

48
00:02:50,620 --> 00:02:52,980
Oh, at the critical moment,

49
00:02:52,980 --> 00:02:54,740
I still have to step in.

50
00:02:55,140 --> 00:02:55,740
Oh, right.

51
00:02:56,020 --> 00:02:58,180
Have you arranged things with Yan Qi?

52
00:02:58,220 --> 00:02:59,500
Has he entered the palace?

53
00:02:59,500 --> 00:03:01,340
I've already informed the palace.

54
00:03:01,740 --> 00:03:04,220
Mr. Yan is entering the capital
today to report on his duties.

55
00:03:06,220 --> 00:03:07,260
Oh, Yuya,

56
00:03:07,900 --> 00:03:10,980
you must seize this opportunity well.

57
00:03:12,460 --> 00:03:13,060
Oh, right.

58
00:03:14,620 --> 00:03:15,620
Is Feng Weiyue

59
00:03:16,580 --> 00:03:18,020
nearby today?

60
00:03:20,140 --> 00:03:20,940
I think so.

61
00:03:24,460 --> 00:03:25,420
Go check.

62
00:03:25,980 --> 00:03:29,300
See what she and Yan Qi
are talking about.

63
00:03:29,660 --> 00:03:30,860
Understood.

64
00:03:33,620 --> 00:03:35,740
Guardian, shall we move?

65
00:03:36,060 --> 00:03:38,180
Not yet. Wait a little longer.

66
00:03:42,860 --> 00:03:44,220
(Kill someone for me.)

67
00:03:53,100 --> 00:03:55,700
Mo Yuya was poisoned long ago
by the Pavilion Master.

68
00:03:55,700 --> 00:03:57,260
It was never fully cured.

69
00:03:59,260 --> 00:04:01,620
I added a poison trigger to the tea.

70
00:04:01,620 --> 00:04:04,660
It will make his poison flare up
and leave him unable to move.

71
00:04:04,860 --> 00:04:05,980
Then,

72
00:04:06,860 --> 00:04:08,260
we kill him.

73
00:04:14,660 --> 00:04:15,420
Boss.

74
00:04:15,940 --> 00:04:16,620
Ye?

75
00:04:16,620 --> 00:04:18,580
Mr. Yan just sent someone
with a letter of apology.

76
00:04:18,740 --> 00:04:20,420
He said His Majesty summoned him
to the palace to report on his duties.

77
00:04:20,420 --> 00:04:21,660
He can't make it.

78
00:04:23,100 --> 00:04:24,420
Why is making money so hard?

79
00:04:24,420 --> 00:04:25,740
Haste makes waste.

80
00:04:25,740 --> 00:04:26,660
No rush.

81
00:04:26,660 --> 00:04:27,860
Rushing won't help.

82
00:04:29,500 --> 00:04:30,660
Qian Ning?

83
00:04:30,900 --> 00:04:31,980
Why are you here too?

84
00:04:32,740 --> 00:04:34,820
Consort Dowager Mei invited His Highness
for tea.

85
00:04:34,940 --> 00:04:36,940
I had nothing to do,
so I wandered around.

86
00:04:37,340 --> 00:04:38,300
Oh, right, Princess Consort,

87
00:04:38,820 --> 00:04:40,420
didn't you have an appointment
with Mr. Yan today?

88
00:04:40,620 --> 00:04:41,780
Why isn't he here?

89
00:04:42,140 --> 00:04:44,180
Don't get me started. He stood me up.

90
00:04:54,740 --> 00:04:55,540
Go!

91
00:05:03,820 --> 00:05:05,140
Who are you?

92
00:05:08,740 --> 00:05:10,100
It's you?

93
00:05:12,660 --> 00:05:14,420
How about we take a walk?

94
00:05:14,420 --> 00:05:14,980
Wait.

95
00:05:16,620 --> 00:05:19,020
A lot of skilled fighters just showed up
from that direction,

96
00:05:19,020 --> 00:05:20,820
and they're all armed.

97
00:05:22,060 --> 00:05:22,820
Oh no.

98
00:05:23,700 --> 00:05:24,860
His Highness is over there.

99
00:05:25,580 --> 00:05:27,100
Where is your Pavilion Master, Gu Nanke?

100
00:05:27,380 --> 00:05:28,540
The Pavilion Master?

101
00:05:29,020 --> 00:05:31,140
She's been missing for three years.

102
00:05:31,580 --> 00:05:34,620
Xingzhao Pavilion can't go a day
without a leader.

103
00:05:35,220 --> 00:05:36,140
Haha!

104
00:05:36,700 --> 00:05:39,540
So I might as well break the rules

105
00:05:40,380 --> 00:05:42,700
and settle this for her.

106
00:05:49,180 --> 00:05:50,180
Everyone stop!

107
00:05:53,100 --> 00:05:54,540
Mo Yuya, are you all right?

108
00:05:54,540 --> 00:05:55,300
Are you hurt?

109
00:05:59,780 --> 00:06:00,660
Pavilion Master?

110
00:06:06,500 --> 00:06:07,340
Pavilion Master.

111
00:06:09,860 --> 00:06:10,700
Pavilion Master?

112
00:06:11,460 --> 00:06:12,900
What Pavilion Master?

113
00:06:14,020 --> 00:06:15,180
You don't recognize me?

114
00:06:18,140 --> 00:06:21,020
I... I think I do recognize you.

115
00:06:21,620 --> 00:06:22,540
Like hell I do!

116
00:06:23,020 --> 00:06:24,340
You think acting friendly
will save your life?

117
00:06:24,700 --> 00:06:25,860
- Ye, get him!
- Yes!

118
00:06:27,300 --> 00:06:27,740
Let's go!

119
00:06:34,980 --> 00:06:35,620
Mo Yuya!

120
00:06:36,180 --> 00:06:36,820
Mo Yuya!

121
00:06:45,740 --> 00:06:46,700
You've been poisoned?

122
00:06:48,540 --> 00:06:49,580
Get up first.

123
00:06:50,580 --> 00:06:51,180
Come on.

124
00:07:04,820 --> 00:07:06,580
How are you? Better now?

125
00:07:08,220 --> 00:07:10,860
I never thought I'd become
a needle stabber one day.

126
00:07:11,380 --> 00:07:12,980
And one who saves lives, no less.

127
00:07:14,700 --> 00:07:16,300
You shouldn't have come here.

128
00:07:23,420 --> 00:07:26,380
This poison has built up
in your body.

129
00:07:26,900 --> 00:07:30,020
It looks like a slow-acting poison
accumulated over time.

130
00:07:31,700 --> 00:07:33,380
Among the ones who know I'm poisoned,

131
00:07:33,980 --> 00:07:35,740
only Pei Chen and Qian Ning remain.

132
00:07:36,660 --> 00:07:38,420
Everyone else is dead.

133
00:07:39,540 --> 00:07:40,580
My goodness.

134
00:07:40,700 --> 00:07:41,300
Why?

135
00:07:41,740 --> 00:07:43,140
You really jinx doctors?

136
00:07:44,100 --> 00:07:45,260
Can't you tell?

137
00:07:46,380 --> 00:07:47,500
My pulse...

138
00:07:48,540 --> 00:07:49,980
Do I still have a chance to live?

139
00:07:50,980 --> 00:07:51,660
You'll live.

140
00:07:51,660 --> 00:07:52,460
I can cure you.

141
00:07:53,620 --> 00:07:54,900
You can cure me?

142
00:07:55,980 --> 00:07:57,460
I've seen every famous doctor.

143
00:07:58,580 --> 00:08:00,460
None of them could do anything.

144
00:08:01,700 --> 00:08:04,020
I said I can cure you, and I will.

145
00:08:05,860 --> 00:08:06,740
Tell me.

146
00:08:08,260 --> 00:08:09,740
What exactly do you want?

147
00:08:12,020 --> 00:08:13,220
Well...

148
00:08:19,180 --> 00:08:20,140
How about this?

149
00:08:20,620 --> 00:08:21,940
You divorce me.

150
00:08:22,260 --> 00:08:23,500
Officially divorce me.

151
00:08:23,500 --> 00:08:24,900
And I'll cure your poison. Deal?

152
00:08:28,420 --> 00:08:30,740
Without my protection,

153
00:08:30,900 --> 00:08:32,620
Xingzhao Pavilion's assassin
could kill you

154
00:08:32,780 --> 00:08:34,340
like shooting fish in a barrel.

155
00:08:34,940 --> 00:08:35,980
So

156
00:08:36,780 --> 00:08:38,700
you want to die, my princess consort.

157
00:08:39,620 --> 00:08:42,300
You knew all along that
they were coming to kill me?

158
00:08:44,820 --> 00:08:46,900
So much for marital devotion.

159
00:08:46,900 --> 00:08:47,860
They've tried to kill me so many times,

160
00:08:47,860 --> 00:08:49,420
and I've never seen you save me once.

161
00:08:50,340 --> 00:08:51,820
But it doesn't matter now.
I have Ye to protect me.

162
00:08:53,260 --> 00:08:54,340
Xingzhao Pavilion

163
00:08:55,740 --> 00:08:57,900
will never stop
until the target is dead.

164
00:08:58,820 --> 00:09:00,540
Ye is getting old now.

165
00:09:00,940 --> 00:09:02,740
Who knows how much longer he'll live?

166
00:09:03,300 --> 00:09:05,540
He might kick the bucket any day.

167
00:09:08,220 --> 00:09:08,980
Achoo!

168
00:09:09,300 --> 00:09:10,060
Hey!

169
00:09:10,380 --> 00:09:12,740
Which scumbag is talking behind my back?

170
00:09:12,740 --> 00:09:13,420
Huh?

171
00:09:15,580 --> 00:09:16,580
Hmm?

172
00:09:18,420 --> 00:09:19,340
Hmm.

173
00:09:19,940 --> 00:09:20,580
Well,

174
00:09:20,740 --> 00:09:22,700
what you said...

175
00:09:23,740 --> 00:09:24,620
Makes sense.

176
00:09:24,620 --> 00:09:25,420
Hey!

177
00:09:27,100 --> 00:09:28,140
How about this?

178
00:09:28,900 --> 00:09:30,460
Let's make a deal.

179
00:09:31,060 --> 00:09:33,140
For every day you treat me,

180
00:09:34,020 --> 00:09:35,380
I'll keep you safe.

181
00:09:36,220 --> 00:09:37,140
Deal?

182
00:09:40,100 --> 00:09:42,820
Could there really be someone
in this world who looks so alike?

183
00:09:43,740 --> 00:09:45,700
She looks exactly like
the Pavilion Master.

184
00:09:46,540 --> 00:09:47,420
But

185
00:09:48,100 --> 00:09:50,980
why does she act like
she doesn't recognize me at all?

186
00:09:53,140 --> 00:09:55,060
But if it really is her,

187
00:09:55,740 --> 00:09:57,260
and she's just on a mission

188
00:09:57,860 --> 00:09:59,180
and can't acknowledge me,

189
00:09:59,260 --> 00:10:01,020
then if she finds out
I've been overstepping

190
00:10:01,020 --> 00:10:02,580
and acting on her behalf...

191
00:10:04,420 --> 00:10:05,380
Guards.

192
00:10:05,660 --> 00:10:06,460
Guardian.

193
00:10:07,580 --> 00:10:09,260
Tell Mo Xuanji

194
00:10:09,260 --> 00:10:11,260
that Xingzhao Pavilion will never

195
00:10:11,260 --> 00:10:12,060
submit to the court.

196
00:10:12,060 --> 00:10:12,860
Understood.

197
00:10:15,220 --> 00:10:18,820
(Gentle Breeze, Serene Ease)

198
00:10:28,860 --> 00:10:33,380
So, these wounds of yours
look like they're years old.

199
00:10:33,700 --> 00:10:35,340
How did you get them?

200
00:10:35,580 --> 00:10:37,580
From a woman named Gu Nanke.

201
00:10:38,940 --> 00:10:40,340
She's an assassin.

202
00:10:46,620 --> 00:10:47,860
She's highly skilled.

203
00:10:48,380 --> 00:10:50,220
She tried to assassinate me many times.

204
00:10:51,300 --> 00:10:51,980
But

205
00:10:52,540 --> 00:10:54,180
there were exceptions too.

206
00:10:59,100 --> 00:11:00,740
Yuanding forces attacked!

207
00:11:00,980 --> 00:11:01,980
General, watch out!

208
00:11:09,900 --> 00:11:12,380
Gu Nanke, why did you save me?

209
00:11:13,300 --> 00:11:15,780
Only I can take your life.

210
00:11:16,820 --> 00:11:19,500
Wow, what a boss lady line.

211
00:11:20,020 --> 00:11:21,740
I love it.

212
00:11:23,500 --> 00:11:24,540
And then what?

213
00:11:24,540 --> 00:11:25,380
Then what?

214
00:11:26,020 --> 00:11:26,580
Later...

215
00:11:28,500 --> 00:11:30,580
I learned she seemed to be
from Yinbei too.

216
00:11:31,220 --> 00:11:33,420
So I tried to sit down
and negotiate with her,

217
00:11:33,660 --> 00:11:34,900
to try to recruit her.

218
00:11:36,020 --> 00:11:37,260
But I never expected...

219
00:11:43,220 --> 00:11:44,260
You're so easy to fool.

220
00:11:47,100 --> 00:11:48,300
Likewise.

221
00:11:49,700 --> 00:11:50,900
Get her!

222
00:11:50,900 --> 00:11:51,780
Don't let her get away!

223
00:11:55,700 --> 00:11:57,980
I have to say it.

224
00:11:58,340 --> 00:12:01,340
You two have a real love-hate
relationship vibe going on.

225
00:12:01,940 --> 00:12:04,460
You got this poison from her back then?

226
00:12:07,980 --> 00:12:09,460
It didn't kill me immediately,

227
00:12:09,860 --> 00:12:12,620
but it's made sure
I'll never live out my years in peace.

228
00:12:13,140 --> 00:12:13,780
Hey.

229
00:12:14,460 --> 00:12:15,260
Don't worry.

230
00:12:15,700 --> 00:12:17,380
With me around,

231
00:12:17,620 --> 00:12:18,940
you'll be fine.

232
00:12:20,540 --> 00:12:21,100
By the way,

233
00:12:21,260 --> 00:12:22,500
I saved you like this,

234
00:12:22,700 --> 00:12:24,260
so can't you just
treat Feng Qingyun better?

235
00:12:24,580 --> 00:12:25,860
Save my life too, won't you?

236
00:12:28,980 --> 00:12:32,220
How did Feng Qingyun
suddenly come into this?

237
00:12:32,780 --> 00:12:34,020
You still don't know?

238
00:12:34,420 --> 00:12:39,020
For you, she hired Xingzhao Pavilion
to kill me.

239
00:12:55,780 --> 00:12:58,660
♪Dazzling my eyes, impossible to clear♪

240
00:12:58,860 --> 00:13:01,180
♪Mist and clouds lock the frosty sky♪

241
00:13:02,820 --> 00:13:05,220
♪Moon waxes and wanes,
true and false blur♪

242
00:13:05,700 --> 00:13:08,020
♪Coming near, then drifting far♪

243
00:13:09,020 --> 00:13:12,020
♪My heart knows it three thousand times♪

244
00:13:12,580 --> 00:13:14,820
♪Flowers mirrored in clear
shallow water♪

245
00:13:15,940 --> 00:13:20,420
♪Black hair spinning a cocoon,
I step toward love's abyss♪

246
00:13:23,300 --> 00:13:25,700
♪Sword in hand, I spur my horse on♪

247
00:13:26,340 --> 00:13:29,020
♪Love and duty cannot both be whole♪

248
00:13:30,180 --> 00:13:32,820
♪Troubles within and without,
home and realm in peril♪

249
00:13:33,180 --> 00:13:35,380
♪Scattered before my eyes♪

250
00:13:36,620 --> 00:13:39,540
♪Wind and snow cannot blow away
my longing♪

251
00:13:39,900 --> 00:13:42,260
♪Letting go is a kind of fulfillment♪

252
00:13:42,940 --> 00:13:44,180
♪This love remains unchanged♪

253
00:13:44,180 --> 00:13:47,700
♪Yet under the moon I make empty wishes♪

254
00:13:49,420 --> 00:13:51,860
♪Ask not of love's poison,
yearning cannot be cut♪

255
00:13:51,980 --> 00:13:55,980
♪In the mortal world jade shatters,
tears of blood run dry♪

256
00:13:56,340 --> 00:13:58,740
♪Ask again of love's poison,
in whose arms will I sleep♪

257
00:13:58,900 --> 00:14:00,600
♪How can I bear a sweet dream♪

258
00:14:00,600 --> 00:14:02,380
♪Turning into doom♪
(Wedding)

259
00:14:03,140 --> 00:14:05,740
♪A path full of thorns,
time won't wait♪

260
00:14:05,740 --> 00:14:10,060
♪I fear this life won't grant us
tender days together♪

261
00:14:10,540 --> 00:14:12,420
♪I don't regret that vow♪

262
00:14:12,620 --> 00:14:15,900
♪Luckily, the phoenix has fallen
into my heart♪
